#: ../../doc/old/tutorials/cv/linear-regression.ipynb:10002
msgid "线性回归"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/tutorials/cv/linear-regression.ipynb:10004
msgid ""
"参考：[linear-regression](https://zh.d2l.ai/chapter_linear-networks/linear-"
"regression.html)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/tutorials/cv/linear-regression.ipynb:10006
msgid "线性回归基于几个简单的假设："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/tutorials/cv/linear-regression.ipynb:10007
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"假设因变量 $\\mathbf{x}$ 和自变量 $y$ 的关系是线性的：即 $y$ 可以表示为 $\\mathbf{x}$ "
"的加权和，通常允许包含观测值的一些噪声。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/tutorials/cv/linear-regression.ipynb:10008
msgid "假设任何噪声都比较正常，如噪声遵循正态分布。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/tutorials/cv/linear-regression.ipynb:10010
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"设定预测结果为 $\\hat{y}$，特征向量 $\\mathbf{x} \\in \\mathbb{R}^d$ 和权重 $\\mathbf{w}"
" \\in \\mathbb{R}^d$，偏置项 $b \\in \\mathbb{R}$，则线性回归可以表示为"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/tutorials/cv/linear-regression.ipynb:10012
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\hat{y} = \\mathbf{w}^\\top \\mathbf{x} + b\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/tutorials/cv/linear-regression.ipynb:10016
msgid ""
"这里 $\\mathbf{x}$ 对应单个样本特征。对于 $n$ 个样本特征集合 $\\mathbf{X} \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n"
" \\times d}$，预测值 $\\hat{\\mathbf{y}} \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$ 可以通过矩阵-向量乘法表示为："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/tutorials/cv/linear-regression.ipynb:10018
msgid ""
"\n"
"{\\hat{\\mathbf{y}}} = \\mathbf{X} \\mathbf{w} + b\n"
msgstr ""

